## Delivered

- Closed-vocabulary, append-only T4 and medical corrections that re-read source
  content, rebuild the effective payload, and re-enter the existing validation,
  parser, mapping, processing, and review gates.
- Explicit, immutable classification overrides retaining the automated result,
  with only T4 and medical targets.
- Explicit duplicate decisions that retain both documents.
- Separate exact-version document acceptance and explicit case finalization.
- Finalization assembles all accepted T4 documents, projects and saves exactly
  one versioned review record, and uses the existing one-time intake association.
- Medical evidence remains outside the T4 review record; no review record is
  created before explicit case finalization.
- The approved `CaseReview` dependency was added to both closed boundary
  allowlists under the narrow T05 ownership amendment; all prior dependencies
  remain required and no other dependency was authorized.

## Scope held

No T06 route, Razor component, browser projection, authorization behaviour,
content-reader implementation, or portal composition-root wiring was added. No
T07 verification-only behaviour was started.
